        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2014-12-10/pdf/2014-29121.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(b) This order shall be implemented consistent with applicable law and \nsubject to the availability of appropriations. \nVerDate Sep<11>2014 19:34 Dec 09, 2014 Jkt 235001 PO 00000 Frm 00003 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\10DEE0.SGM 10DEE0mstockstill on DSK4VPTVN1PROD with E0\n=== PDF page 2 of 2 ===\n73460 Federal Register / Vol. 79, No. 237 / Wednesday, December 10, 2014 / Presidential Documents"
    },
